# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variables for the Kenya Childhood Malnutrition Risk Prediction
# System web dashboard.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (for local dev) or set the same keys in
# your Vercel project's Environment Variables settings for production.
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL — the app works with zero configuration by
# falling back to the bundled static JSON data file.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Neon Postgres connection string (optional).
# When set, the dashboard reads live data from Neon instead of the bundled JSON.
# Format: postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DBNAME?sslmode=require
# Get yours at: https://console.neon.tech
DATABASE_URL=

# Vercel Analytics + Speed Insights are auto-enabled when deployed on Vercel.
# No env var required — they pick up the project automatically.
